  },
  "description": "Mirror appointments to Google Calendar (doctor calendar, else branch calendar) with a service account: event id = appointment uuid without dashes, so a repeated create is idempotent. Marks gcal_synced_at only if the appointment did not change meanwhile. A failed sync is data, not an execution error: the appointment is retried with backoff (gcal_next_at) and the third failure in a row raises one incident, closed by the next successful sync."
